        "latin": "Fa-Allāhumma lakal-ḥamdu ‘alā ḥilmika ba‘da ‘ilmik, wa lakal-ḥamdu ‘alā ‘afwika ba‘da qudratik. Allāhumma lakal-ḥamdu kulluh, wa bi-yadikal-khayru kulluh, wa ilayka yarji‘ul-amru kulluh, ‘alāniyatuhu wa sirruh. Allāhumma innī aḥmaduka bi-maḥāmidika kullihā, mā ‘alimtu minhā wa mā lam a‘lam. Yā Rabbi, lakal-ḥamdu kamā yanbaghī li-jalāli wajhika wa ‘aẓīmi sulṭānik. Subḥānaka lā nuḥṣī thanā'an ‘alayk, Anta kamā athnayta ‘alā nafsik.",
